### Gradle ###
.gradle/
build/
!**/src/main/**/build/
!**/src/test/**/build/
/bin/

# The wrapper jar MUST stay tracked, or ./gradlew fails for anyone who clones.
# It is re-included explicitly right after the *.jar rule below (last match wins).

### Compiled output ###
*.class

# Package files
*.jar
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
*.war
*.nar
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar

### Secrets / local credentials — never commit ###
**/secrets.*
**/secrets*
.env
*.env*

# NOTE: application-local.yml IS tracked in all three modules — it is ordinary
# local profile config that optionally imports the untracked secrets.yml above.

